{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act19side_act19side_sub-1-1",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_s01",
  "title": "Dilemma",
  "storyCode": "DV-S-1",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level/act19side_sub-1-1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e4127e4e5df36b370368419d86ba678475fab6d55bab5e3f85b518a81aa8591f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Here, the data you asked for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Thanks, Ferdinand. I didn't think you'd hand it over personally."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We were able to retrieve most of the Loken Watertank data thanks to you. The fewer that know about this, the better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I'm curious as to why you wanted these data."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She gazes at the monitor in front of her, so focused that even her breathing slows down.\nA video of a girl with white hair is playing.\nThe girl spends most of her time sleeping, eating, or sitting in a corner with a blank look on her face.\nFrom time to time, she is led into a lab, where she crushes furniture placed in a room separated by a 1-meter thick wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a beautiful child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You remind me of Loken Williams. I thought only madmen boast about their test subjects."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sure, he's been accused of crossing a moral line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Morals are shackles that the short-sighted impose upon themselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Science has never been bound by common sense. There is no greater insult to a scientist than to be judged by moral standards."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Williams's problem was that he allowed the infinite unknown to get the better of his sanity, and he abandoned the logic and reason a scientist must grip."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "See at the end of the video how your 'beautiful child' turned the lab into a nightmarish catastrophe."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The monitor is showing a different image.\nThere is no recorded sound, but the screams seem to pierce the screen and fill a lab from another time.\nThe fallen debris does not hide the bloodstains."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened to the girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Records pertaining to her have been tampered with. Like the other legacies of Loken Watertank, she has value to somebody, somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to find her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "May I assume you're considering ending Williams's experiments?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She is too difficult to control. A risk Rhine Lab cannot afford."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She didn't volunteer to be a test subject. I can't ask something so cruel of her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You want to heal her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're not doctors, but anyone whose seen the experiments in their entirety should not harbor such delusions."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, Ferdinand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All I want to do is find her... and give her a hug."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A... a hug?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The girl... she's all alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They took her family from her, and made her something entirely different from all other people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't help but think... where is she now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Has she made new friends? Or new enemies?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I want to hear her voice..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I can't change her past, but the future may not be lost yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know, Dorothy... I really have no idea what you're thinking at times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ferdinand",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_522_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not many scientists are as sentimental as you are. You're not bound by logic or reason either. Perhaps, one day, your madness will put Williams's to shame..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Madness? I've seen this in my dreams, many times."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's why I want to find the girl."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If she's still alive... if anyone can save her from her past..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dorothy",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4048_doroth_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then maybe someone will be there to stop me, if I really do go over the edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
